# LF on checkout, on every platform.
#
# `zig fmt --check` fails on CRLF source (verified against Zig 0.16.0) even though
# the compiler itself accepts it. Without this, a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true breaks the fmt step locally while CI stays green on Linux —
# a per-developer failure that looks like a tooling bug.
#
# Six targets, one line ending.
* text=auto eol=lf
